        <Text>Mostrar, Ample, Altura, Llargada, LlargadaAut, Gruix,
            desplX, desplY,
            mostrarLiniaVertA,desplLinA,mostrarLiniaVertB,desplLinB,
            Is Global Prop Vert, Color, Layer,
